            <mn>-</mn>
            <mi>k</mi>
            <mi>x</mi>
        </math>
        Pictured: the spring force, as a product of the spring<br />
        coefficient <b><i>k&nbsp;</i></b> and the distance from equilibrium <b
            ><i>x&nbsp;</i></b
        >.
    </Figure>
    <Figure id="math-ma" x="0.5" y="0.5" class="active" border={true}>
        <math slot="figure">
            <mi>F</mi>
            <mo>=</mo>
            <mi>m</mi>
            <mi>a</mi>
